# One optional work-tab replacement, staged on top of the minimal set. One mod per pass on purpose:
# these overlap, and two of them share a packageId (Fluffy.WorkTab), so the first place a staging
# finds a mod wins and a pass naming both would silently test only one.
#
# What the pass is FOR: whether this mod's work tab controls survive a replacement work tab. This
# mod patches WidgetsWork.DrawWorkBoxBackground itself, so any mod that still calls it should show
# these icons; the assembly of the replacement references that method twice. Read as a presumption,
# not a proof - a reference in metadata says the method is cited, not that it is on the render path.
#
natee.EnhancedWorkTab 3715873875
